        "cooked": "<p>I've seen two versions of this Spirit. One has in the spirit \"Gain topmost Minor Power granting Animal\" while the other version has the spirit \"Pay 2 Energy to gain a Minor Power\". My question is, which one is the most updated version?</p>\n<p>https://www.docdroid.net/sBLCin0/many-minds-move-as-one.pdf - Animal Granting Power</p>\n<p>https://www.docdroid.net/ArliIKE/new-spiritsaspects-12-2018.pdf#page=11 - Pay 2 Energy</p>\n<p>Thank you in advance.</p>",
